\item Joshua Project people-group profile: \url{https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/20568}
\end{itemize}

\section{Digital and Audio Resources}
\begin{itemize}
\item Global Recordings Network language page: \url{https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/fkk}
\end{itemize}

\section{Curriculum Development Context}
The language is vigorous in homes and farms, but no written educational material was found; literacy is in Hausa. Curriculum work would need community orthography and materials development.
\end{document}
